# Browser-facing API URL. Leave unset during `npm run dev` so Axios uses `/api` (proxied by Vite to the backend).
# Set this ONLY if `/api` is not reachable from the SPA (broken proxy, or testing without Vite).
# Include the `/api` suffix. Restart `npm run dev` after editing.
#
# Example (direct FastAPI):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001/api

# Where Vite dev/preview proxies `/api` (Node env; rebuild/restart dev server after change)
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:8001
